```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Race Condition Fix Demo</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 640px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 16px; }
  button { font-size: 16px; padding: 8px 16px; cursor: pointer; }
